  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Democracy and Electoral Freedom in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will provide support to the 2023 electoral cycle to ensure that the elections are peaceful in spite of recent political tensions, often resulting in violence, in the country. The programme will be implemented through the organisation of town hall meetings, facilitated dialogue sessions and community theatre to foster national cohesion and political inclusiveness ensuring that Sierra Leoneans understand and appreciate the importance of these notions.</narrative>
  </description>
